00:00:32.567 --> 00:00:33.767
-Well, now that my kid's here,

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:35.801
can you guys help me
start the show?

00:00:35.801 --> 00:00:37.334
-Sure.
-Sure.

00:00:37.334 --> 00:00:39.200
-Welcome to Good Burger 2,

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.067
home of the Good Burger 2.

00:00:41.067 --> 00:00:43.567
